1
00:00:04,302 --> 00:00:06,349
Benchmarks give a model one score.

2
00:00:06,399 --> 00:00:09,495
Model Cartographer finds where a model breaks, and why.

3
00:00:09,545 --> 00:00:19,632
Each globe is one model, and each flame is its pass rate in one province of skill, from tracking a story to fixing a bug in a real repository.

4
00:00:21,882 --> 00:00:27,727
Every task is generated from a simulated world, so the right answer comes from running that world.

5
00:00:27,777 --> 00:00:29,461
There is no LLM judge.

6
00:00:29,511 --> 00:00:32,582
Difficulty dials go up until the model stops passing.

7
00:00:34,831 --> 00:00:39,698
NVIDIA's open Nemotron 3 models are both the subjects and the engine.

8
00:00:39,748 --> 00:00:49,941
Nano, Super and Ultra ran forty-five hundred trials through Nebius Token Factory for under six dollars, on identical tasks, so their breaking points compare directly.

9
00:00:52,194 --> 00:00:56,488
Breaking points reports each result in the task's own units.

10
00:00:56,538 --> 00:01:01,265
Nemotron 3 Super breaks at twenty-four-call plans with look-alike tool names.

11
00:01:01,315 --> 00:01:03,003
Nano breaks at thirteen.

12
00:01:03,053 --> 00:01:05,174
Ultra only slips, at twenty-five.

13
00:01:07,424 --> 00:01:11,589
Inside the app, Nemotron does the analysis live, through Token Factory.

14
00:01:11,639 --> 00:01:12,739
Ask a question.

15
00:01:12,789 --> 00:01:17,720
Nemotron 3 Nano, with thinking turned off, routes it in about a second.

16
00:01:17,770 --> 00:01:21,551
The app pulls the matching facts from the results store.

17
00:01:21,601 --> 00:01:29,214
Nemotron 3 Super answers from those facts only, citing each one, and a deterministic audit checks every number it used.

18
00:01:31,466 --> 00:01:37,663
Findings link every weakness to the trials behind it, and each trial to its full transcript.

19
00:01:37,713 --> 00:01:48,596
On a failed trial, Nemotron 3 Ultra, the reasoning tier, explains the mistake from the prompt and the verified answer, with the verifier's own classification shown beside it.

20
00:01:50,990 --> 00:01:57,970
Nemotron 3 Super also writes the capability report, and every figure it quotes is audited against the store.

21
00:02:00,224 --> 00:02:06,853
Model Cartographer is open source under the MIT license, and it's live at model-cartographer dot vercel dot app.

22
00:02:06,903 --> 00:02:10,564
Find out where your model breaks, before your users do.
